{"module":"phrases","item":{"id":"a2-phrases-meinungen","level":"A2","title":{"de":"Meinungen","bn":"Meinungen · মতামত ও প্রতিক্রিয়া","en":"Opinions and reactions"},"icon":"chatbubbles-outline","entries":[{"id":"a2-ph-meinungen-meiner-meinung-nach","de":"Meiner Meinung nach ...","bn":"আমার মতে ...","en":"In my opinion ..."},{"id":"a2-ph-meinungen-ich-bin-damit-einverstanden","de":"Ich bin damit einverstanden.","bn":"আমি এতে একমত।","en":"I agree with that."},{"id":"a2-ph-meinungen-ich-bin-anderer-meinung","de":"Ich bin anderer Meinung.","bn":"আমার মত ভিন্ন।","en":"I have a different opinion."},{"id":"a2-ph-meinungen-das-sehe-ich-genauso","de":"Das sehe ich genauso.","bn":"আমিও ঠিক একইভাবে দেখি।","en":"I see it the same way."},{"id":"a2-ph-meinungen-da-hast-du-recht","de":"Da hast du recht.","bn":"এ ব্যাপারে তুমি ঠিক।","en":"You're right about that."},{"id":"a2-ph-meinungen-ich-glaube-schon","de":"Ich glaube schon.","bn":"আমার মনে হয় তাই।","en":"I think so."},{"id":"a2-ph-meinungen-ich-glaube-eher-nicht","de":"Ich glaube eher nicht.","bn":"আমার তা মনে হয় না।","en":"I don't think so."},{"id":"a2-ph-meinungen-das-kommt-darauf-an","de":"Das kommt darauf an.","bn":"এটা পরিস্থিতির ওপর নির্ভর করে।","en":"It depends."},{"id":"a2-ph-meinungen-das-finde-ich-interessant","de":"Das finde ich interessant.","bn":"আমার কাছে এটা আকর্ষণীয় মনে হয়।","en":"I find that interesting."},{"id":"a2-ph-meinungen-ich-kann-das-verstehen","de":"Ich kann das verstehen.","bn":"আমি এটা বুঝতে পারছি।","en":"I can understand that."}],"test":[{"id":"test-a2-phrases-meinungen-a1","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Meiner Meinung nach ...“","promptBn":"এর অর্থ কোনটি?","options":["আমার মতে ...","আমার তা মনে হয় না।","আমার মনে হয় তাই।"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Meiner Meinung nach ... = আমার মতে ... (In my opinion ...)"},{"id":"test-a2-phrases-meinungen-a2","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ich bin anderer Meinung.“","promptBn":"এর অর্থ কোনটি?","options":["আমার মত ভিন্ন।","আমি এটা বুঝতে পারছি।","এ ব্যাপারে তুমি ঠিক।"],"a